; 2026-08-17 (Camil, after batch balance testing showed Controleur at
; 100% win rate across all 448 AI-vs-AI matches): "diviser les PV des
; tourelles par 2 me semble bien" — was 22, keeping lifetime/damage as-is
; per his call ("je ne baisserais pas le lifetime"). Paired with the AI
; turret-targeting fix in ship_node.gd (_ai_find_enemy_turret()) so a
; turret is now actually killable instead of sitting unmolested for its
; full 25s.
