; 2026-08-17 follow-up: the AI-behavior fixes (turret-targeting Y-blend,
; then risk-tolerant dodge suppression) never meaningfully dented
; Controleur's win rate across 5 full re-test batches (stayed 97-100%) —
; real matches have the ball crossing sides constantly, fragmenting any
; "safe window" to press the attack before it's interrupted again. Camil:
; "on va reduire un petit peu (1/4) la duree de vie des tourelles" — a
; numeric lever guaranteed to work regardless of AI skill, unlike the
; behavior fixes above (kept in ship_node.gd regardless — still correct
; for a human player closing in). Was 25.0, -25%.
